    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">excŭbātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		excubo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a watching</i>, <i>keeping watch.</i>
			* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ab excubatione desistere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 49, 16, 3, § 6</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">perpetua pro dignitate et salute amicorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 4, 7, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
